<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-10-20T01:58:18.088Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 01:58:18 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraq is now coping with security gaps after the complete US troop withdrawal, while Baghdad and Tehran deepen cooperation by activating joint security committees and discussing stronger ties. Iraqi authorities are pursuing legal action against media incitement supporting pro-Iran armed groups, arresting a lawyer who brandished a gun in court and urging prosecutions, and the Kurdistan-based YBŞ is negotiating integration into state security forces. Heritage reconstruction continues in Nineveh and the Jordanian king has invited the Iraqi president for regional de-escalation talks. The conflict recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE5vNWZWLXZUelN5UkwtNjE3NFdmS3R4QlVLeDBpamtiT2RqbnZwbVgtT0t0VDROczQ3YUwzeUptNHU2WVF5Ri1EYUF1ZGVaWGt2MUhkMklpMVM0TE1fUUZUU2F4Y3JhVjIxV0hKU08wb0F3aHF4bThYYg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxNUjZoclRLVTlObk1aWTlscEhLSnZyOURudDUxd1plSEJRS2Roc3dRYjdqaVB0TWVPaHVodlZ1RmVESE1ZbXRxVlVpYUZwbmFScF84am02N1RCSERCUkQ2ZFQzX2ZuTXZfVjk0ZTdjMmcydUw2RkV4VVFjR3lObXdsNGZMb2lNcHp5ek1FNVM1dWMtOTg?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPSmNrWTFFN2lLR1VlNkozckJlRlZzQVlHVFA4NEpFaEJkOE1BS2NvVDl5UW01MUc5Unp3U1dVWTU4XzVlNFFQdmVORm1DVEYzYzBkeEgtMHdpLVc0SVBGQl9JeWtoU2VNbVNudzZ0dDdMZ0RxQjJpdHlCanpXeFEtUDBhZVN1WlM4VlkyTHA3TldNZEhReXZudXVBR2dRWkh3eFJNdFhDLXhYQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiTkFVX3lxTE5sQTdCSnVZYWNMNUpqbFNsTUVjc2xaQXpYN3M3ekg3VTNGOE1TYi1hT1lhNGhoZXlqR3IzYWU3YzE4RGRXMnZjSmR1S091dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;PUKmedia یەکێتیی نیشتمانیی کوردستان&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTE1jSHI